e1si megjegyz\u00e9s<\/p><p>\ud83d\udc49 gain _______ = szak\u00e9rtelemet szerez (pl. She gained considerable _______ in project management.)<\/p><p>\ud83d\udc49 share _______ = megosztja a szak\u00e9rtelm\u00e9t (pl. He was always willing to share his _______ with junior colleagues.)<\/p><p>\ud83d\udc49 draw on _______ = szak\u00e9rtelemre t\u00e1maszkodik (pl. The team drew on external _______ to solve the crisis.)<\/p><p>\ud83d\udc49 area of _______ = szakter\u00fclet (pl. His main area of _______ is artificial intelligence.)<\/p><p>\ud83d\udc49 lack of _______ = szak\u00e9rtelem hi\u00e1nya (pl. The project failed due to a lack of _______.)<\/p>","front_notes":null,"front_speak":null,"back":"<p><strong>expertise<\/strong><\/p><p>noun: <strong>expertise<\/strong><\/p><p><span style=\"color: #3b82f6\">common pair: technical expertise \/ domain expertise \/ subject matter expertise \/ legal expertise<\/span><\/p><p>similar: proficiency \/ skill \/ knowledge \/ mastery<\/p><p><span style=\"color: #ef4444\">negative: incompetence \/ inexperience \/ ignorance<\/span><\/p>","back_notes":null,"back_speak":"expertise","study_direction":"back_to_front","color":"#6366f1","review":{"state":"learning","interval":0,"lapses":0,"is_leech":false},"previews":{"again":"1 perc","hard":"45 perc","good":"1 \u00f3ra","easy":"2 nap"},"other_side_due_at":"2026-05-20T21:41:21+00:00"},{"id":51337,"front":"<p>The detective tried to solve the _______ of the missing jewels. <em>(rejt\u00e9ly \/ tal\u00e1ny)<\/em><\/p><p>It&#039;s a _______ to me how he manages to juggle so many responsibilities. <em>(rejt\u00e9ly \/ felfoghatatlan dolog)<\/em><\/p><p>The ancient text presented a philosophical _______ that scholars have debated for centuries. <em>(tal\u00e1ny \/ fejt\u00f6r\u0151)<\/em><\/p><p>She loved to tell her grandchildren a _______ before bedtime, always with a clever answer. <em>(tal\u00e1l\u00f3s k\u00e9rd\u00e9s \/ fejt\u00f6r\u0151)<\/em><\/p><p><span style=\"color: #22c55e\">rejt\u00e9ly \/ tal\u00e1ny \/ tal\u00e1l\u00f3s k\u00e9rd\u00e9s<\/span><\/p><p><span style=\"background-color: #f3f4f6; padding: 2px 6px; border-radius: 4px\">Negative meaning (HU): megold\u00e1s \/ magyar\u00e1zat \/ egy\u00e9rtelm\u0171s\u00e9g<\/span><\/p><p>\ud83d\udd11 Tanul\u00e1si megjegyz\u00e9s<\/p><p>\ud83d\udc49 solve a _______ = megold egy rejt\u00e9lyt\/tal\u00e1nyt (pl. Can you help me solve this _______?)<\/p><p>\ud83d\udc49 a _______ wrapped in an enigma = rejt\u00e9ly a rejt\u00e9lyben (nagyon bonyolult, \u00e9rthetetlen dolog) (pl. His past is a _______ wrapped in an enigma.)<\/p><p>\ud83d\udc49 pose a _______ = felvet egy rejt\u00e9lyt\/tal\u00e1nyt (pl. The discovery continues to pose a _______ for scientists.)<\/p><p>\ud83d\udc49 a complete _______ = teljes rejt\u00e9ly (pl. His sudden disappearance remains a complete _______.)<\/p>","front_notes":null,"front_speak":null,"back":"<p><strong>riddle<\/strong><\/p><p>noun: <strong>riddle<\/strong><\/p><p>verb: <strong>riddle<\/strong><\/p><p><span style=\"color: #3b82f6\">common pair: solve a riddle \/ pose a riddle \/ a complete riddle \/ riddle of existence<\/span><\/p><p>similar: mystery \/ puzzle \/ enigma \/ conundrum<\/p><p><span style=\"color: #ef4444\">negative: solution \/ answer \/ explanation<\/span><\/p>","back_notes":null,"back_speak":"riddle","study_direction":"back_to_front","color":"#6366f1","review":{"state":"learning","interval":0,"lapses":0,"is_leech":false},"previews":{"again":"1 perc","hard":"15 perc","good":"30 perc","easy":"2 nap"},"other_side_due_at":"2026-05-20T22:30:50+00:00"},{"id":51335,"front":"<p>The old pirate map supposedly led to a hidden _______ of gold and jewels. <em>(kincs \/ vagyon)<\/em><\/p><p>She will always _______ the memories of her grandmother&#039;s stories. <em>(f\u00e9ltve \u0151riz \/ becsben tart)<\/em><\/p><p>For many, a good education is considered the greatest _______. <em>(\u00e9rt\u00e9k \/ kincs)<\/em><\/p><p>The museum decided to _______ the ancient artifacts in a climate-controlled vault. <em>(meg\u0151riz \/ v\u00e9d)<\/em><\/p><p><span style=\"color: #22c55e\">kincs \/ becsben tart \/ f\u00e9ltve \u0151riz<\/span><\/p><p><span style=\"background-color: #f3f4f6; padding: 2px 6px; border-radius: 4px\">Negative meaning (HU): szem\u00e9t \/ \u00e9rt\u00e9ktelen dolog \/ hullad\u00e9k<\/span><\/p><p>\ud83d\udd11 Tanul\u00e1si megjegyz\u00e9s<\/p><p>\ud83d\udc49 hidden _______ = rejtett kincs (pl. They searched for the hidden _______ in the cave.)<\/p><p>\ud83d\udc49 national _______ = nemzeti kincs (pl. The ancient crown is a national _______.)<\/p><p>\ud83d\udc49 to _______ memories = eml\u00e9keket \u0151riz\/becsben tart (pl. I will always _______ the memories of our trip.)<\/p><p>\ud83d\udc49 a _______ trove = kincsesb\u00e1nya (\u00e1tvitt \u00e9rtelemben) (pl. The old bookstore was a _______ trove of rare editions.)<\/p>","front_notes":null,"front_speak":null,"back":"<p><strong>treasure<\/strong><\/p><p>adjective: <strong>treasured<\/strong><\/p><p>noun: <strong>treasure<\/strong><\/p><p>verb: <strong>treasure<\/strong><\/p><p><span style=\"color: #3b82f6\">common pair: treasure chest \/ treasure hunt \/ treasure trove \/ buried treasure<\/span><\/p><p>similar: riches \/ wealth \/ gem \/ prize<\/p><p><span style=\"color: #ef4444\">negative: junk \/ rubbish \/ trash<\/span><\/p>","back_notes":null,"back_speak":"treasure","study_direction":"front_to_back","color":"#6366f1","review":{"state":"learning","interval":0,"lapses":0,"is_leech":false},"previews":{"again":"1 perc","hard":"45 perc","good":"1 \u00f3ra","easy":"2 nap"},"other_side_due_at":"2026-05-20T22:01:00+00:00"},{"id":51336,"front":"<p>Please write a complete _______ using correct grammar and punctuation. <em>(mondat \/ nyelvtani egys\u00e9g)<\/em><\/p><p>The judge will deliver the _______ tomorrow, determining the fate of the accused. <em>(\u00edt\u00e9let \/ b\u00edr\u00f3s\u00e1gi d\u00f6nt\u00e9s)<\/em><\/p><p>He received a suspended _______