 repercussions.)<\/p><p>\ud83d\udc49 sacred _______ = szent sz\u00f6vets\u00e9g (pl. The ancient people honored their sacred _______.)<\/p><p>\ud83d\udc49 new _______ = \u00faj sz\u00f6vets\u00e9g (pl. The concept of a new _______ is central to Christianity.)<\/p>","front_notes":null,"front_speak":null,"back":"<p><strong>covenant<\/strong><\/p><p>noun: <strong>covenant<\/strong><\/p><p><span style=\"color: #3b82f6\">common pair: sacred covenant \/ new covenant \/ make a covenant \/ break a covenant<\/span><\/p><p>similar: agreement \/ pact \/ treaty \/ bond<\/p><p><span style=\"color: #ef4444\">negative: disagreement \/ breach \/ rupture<\/span><\/p>","back_notes":null,"back_speak":"covenant","study_direction":"back_to_front","color":"#6366f1","review":{"state":"learning","interval":0,"lapses":0,"is_leech":false},"previews":{"again":"1 perc","hard":"15 perc","good":"30 perc","easy":"2 nap"},"other_side_due_at":"2026-05-20T21:59:37+00:00"},{"id":51340,"front":"<p>The jockey used his _______ to encourage the horse to run faster in the final stretch. <em>(ostor \/ korb\u00e1cs)<\/em><\/p><p>She had to _______ up a quick meal for the unexpected guests. <em>(\u00f6sszedob \/ gyorsan elk\u00e9sz\u00edt)<\/em><\/p><p>The party leader tried to _______ his supporters into action with an impassioned speech. <em>(felkorb\u00e1csol \/ \u00f6szt\u00f6n\u00f6z \/ felr\u00e1z)<\/em><\/p><p>A cold _______ of wind swept across the open plains, chilling them to the bone. <em>(csap\u00e1s \/ hirtelen mozdulat)<\/em><\/p><p><span style=\"color: #22c55e\">ostoroz \/ felkorb\u00e1csol \/ \u00f6sszedob \/ ostor<\/span><\/p><p><span style=\"background-color: #f3f4f6; padding: 2px 6px; border-radius: 4px\">Negative meaning (HU): simogat \/ nyugtat \/ lass\u00edt<\/span><\/p><p>\ud83d\udd11 Tanul\u00e1si megjegyz\u00e9s<\/p><p>\ud83d\udc49 _______ up support = t\u00e1mogat\u00e1st szerez\/felkorb\u00e1csol (pl. The candidate tried to _______ up support for his campaign.)<\/p><p>\ud83d\udc49 